-> Every flight of carrier X in Q1 or Q2 2025 receives the same average fare. Do not interpret the fare column as a per-route or per-flight price. 
Fares are quarterly; delays and weather are monthly/hourly. A January flight gets the Q1 average; a June flight gets the Q2 average. That is a quarterly aggregation, not a per-flight price. 
higher_priced definition used: top tercile (fare_pct_rank > 2/3) of airlines by average_market_fare_current, computed within each quarter. 
Everyone must use this same definition. Weather was checked to be unique per airport_code × weather_date × weather_hour.
